Adds a complete web-based code generator for 1С:Предприятие with 28 templates covering BSP (Библиотека стандартных подсистем) integration, advanced queries, data operations, and exchange patterns.

## Implementation

### Template Library (`js/templates.js`)
- **📦 БСП (BSP)**: 10 templates for standard subsystem integration (email, logging, background jobs, temp storage, printing, SMS, files, counterparty lookup, user settings, notifications)
- **📁 Queries**: 5 templates including batch queries with temp tables, virtual tables for accumulation registers, hierarchy totals, and UNION operations
- **📁 Data Work**: 4 templates for controlled transactions with locking, document movements, and batch updates
- **📁 Interface**: 4 templates for dynamic list filters, conditional appearance, and async user dialogs
- **🔄 Data Exchange**: 3 templates for XML import/export and JSON serialization (XDTO)
- **📁 Event Handlers**: 2 templates for object lifecycle events

### Web Application
- Category navigation with template counts
- Full-text search with term highlighting
- Modal editor with live parameter substitution
- Copy-to-clipboard for generated code
- Zero dependencies, vanilla JavaScript

### Example Template Usage

```javascript
// БСП Background Job Template
{
  id: "bsp_long_operation",
  name: "Длительная операция БСП (фоновое задание с прогрессом)",
  params: [
    { name: "procedureName", default: "ВыполнитьОперацию" },
    { name: "waitMessage", default: "Выполняется операция..." },
    // ... 5 more parameters
  ],
  code: `// Client-side, server-side, and completion handlers
&НаКлиенте
Процедура {{procedureName}}(Команда)
    ДлительнаяОперация = {{procedureName}}НаСервере();
    // ... full implementation
КонецПроцедуры`
}
```

